{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1524124-another-sample-idea-for-a-fangame","id":1524124,"title":"another sample idea for a fangame!","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2023-10-15T22:07:09-07:00","id":1524124,"title":"another sample idea for a fangame!","content":"i'm once again blessed and cursed with ideas for Fangames I don't have time or energy to make, but I still talk it out with you guys. Maybe find a title, just for funsies<br /> ]<br /> So, The Chronicles of Darkness. It's broken, isn't it?<br /> Whatever the truest state of the CofD is, it's damn near objectively that the entirety of existence is wrongg on a deep, deep level.<br /> Many of the human and supernatural groups of the CofD have their own answers for that.<br /> This Fangame's Protagonists say the CofD used to have... things that were Erased on the conceptual level. One protagonist might say<br /> &quot;There used to be nine days of the week, two were Erased!&quot;<br /> Another one might say<br /> &quot;I hear the call of a six class of animals in my dreams, an entire class was Erased,&quot; he says sobbing<br /> This is the truth as they remember it,once the world of the CofD had many, many wonderful things and then someone or something Erased them. but whatever it was,it didn't do it's job thoroughly,because a little bit of the essence of the Erased Things lives in the protagonists of the gameline<br /> With effort, they can bring back their Erased Concepts,their **Remembrance **for short periods of time<br /> they can make people remember what was forgotten<br /> but will they?<br /> the main supported playstyle would be bringing the Remembrances back,and take can take many shapes. Conflict would arise from 2 sources<br /> The Remembrances Sometimes compete with each other,your Remembrance's return might very well be in the way of another ...'s Remembrance Return!<br /> There is a Man In Black slash evil cult trying to get rid of you (how could i not have one? this is a cofd game)<br /> <br /> The whole system for bringing your Remembrance back, is thematically, and tonally similar to the New Dawn from Promethean<br /> even the game mechanics of it would be similar<br /> lemme give you an Example<br /> **Paul** woke up one day with the dreams of a lost Renaissance artist in his head, one that every single history book tells never existed.<br /> Well, he isn't gonna take that in stride!<br /> Paul then discovers he has powers,and that he has been targeted by the Enemy Cult.<br /> He then quickly uses his powers to achieve milestones, each milestone burns the Artist more and more into reality.<br /> until Paul reaches the Final Remembrance and BLAM!<br /> The artist has existed now<br /> and always has\u200b\u200b","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-10-16T01:10:26-07:00","id":1524129,"title":"","content":"What are the powers? And where do they come from? Are they themed around the erasured iten?<br /> <br /> How does one become a rememberer? Is it like a Werewolf's first change, where they are born with the potential bht then one day something triggers/sets them off?<br /> <br /> Do they form any social/political groupings with others of their kind?<br /> <br /> Once they have irrevocably altered reality, are they done? Do they still have any power (or is it now all invested into the Universe)?<br /> <br /> What other antagobists would they have? Agents of the status quo (maybe related to the god-machine)? Mad rememberers who think other people's ideas are wrong and must be stopped? Whatever unknowable horror which erased things in the first place?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27248-orathaic","name":"orathaic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27248_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1032"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-10-16T12:42:52-07:00","id":1524146,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>orathaic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1524124-another-sample-idea-for-a-fangame?p=1524129#post1524129\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">What are the powers? And where do they come from? Are they themed around the erasured iten?<br /> <br /> How does one become a rememberer? Is it like a Werewolf's first change, where they are born with the potential bht then one day something triggers/sets them off?<br /> <br /> Do they form any social/political groupings with others of their kind?<br /> <br /> Once they have irrevocably altered reality, are they done? Do they still have any power (or is it now all invested into the Universe)?<br /> <br /> What other antagobists would they have? Agents of the status quo (maybe related to the god-machine)? Mad rememberers who think other people's ideas are wrong and must be stopped? Whatever unknowable horror which erased things in the first place?</div> </div> </div> </div>I LOVE THOSE QUESTIONS!<br /> <br /> \u200b\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200bBecoming a Remember is totally random,it can happen with anyone, anywhere.<br /> they form political/social groups yes,I'm still cooking them up<br /> They can choose to bring back more things before they complete their Final Remembrance, but it's so difficult most chose not to<br /> Antagonists include rival Rememberers and the many cults of the Evil Thing that Erased things in the First Place","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4621,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","user":"Nicolas Milioni","date":". 10-16-2023, 03:54 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-10-17T06:18:01-07:00","id":1524192,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nicolas Milioni</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1524124-another-sample-idea-for-a-fangame#post1524124\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">iThis Fangame's Protagonists say the CofD used to have... things that were Erased on the conceptual level.</div> </div> </div> </div>What makes this different to Mage? Like, that's how the Supernal works. Plus, your description of what Rememberer's do sound very close to what archmasters do.<br /> <br /> I'm not saying to stop you, just curious if you've thought of this angle.","signature":"<hr 